    <h1>Project showcase</h1>
    <p class="summary">
        As a fan of space, airplanes, simulations and sandbox games, I'm working on a big game project that
        would bring all these interests together. <br>
        However, I soon came up against the limitations of existing game
        engines, hence the idea of creating my own game engine for that purpose because - Hell yeah, why not !?<br>
        All of these projects are, in way or another, a little brick toward that larger goal, honing my skills to
        bring me closer to the day when I can realize my dream.
    </p>
    <p style="font-style: italic">Yeah, it's indeed unrealistic, but I'm having a lot of fun doing this stuff !
